        (<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>), <a href="https://www.noaa.gov/">NOAA</a> and
        <a href="https://eccc-msc.github.io/open-data/licence/readme_en/">Environment and Climate Change Canada</a>,
        processed with <a href="https://meteo.azohra.com/">meteo by Azohra</a>.
        Official forecasts: <a href="https://www.weather.gov/">National Weather Service</a>.
        ECMWF IFS: © <a href="https://www.ecmwf.int/">ECMWF</a>,
        <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>, via <a href="https://open-meteo.com/">Open-Meteo</a>.
        Balloons: NWS via the <a href="https://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/archive/raob/">Iowa Environmental Mesonet</a>.
        Station feeds: <a href="https://www.wunderground.com/">Weather Underground</a>. Launch catalogue: flyingsites.
        Armenian and New Zealand launch data: <a href="https://paraglidingearth.com/">ParaglidingEarth contributors</a>,
