        Regional elevation products contain information licensed under the
        <a href="https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada">Open Government Licence – Canada</a>
        and the <a href="https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/data/open-data/open-government-licence-bc">Open Government Licence – British Columbia</a>.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</Base>
